### Connexion de démo : Lucas
# @name lucas
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/demo-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "STUDENT", "id": 1 }

### Connexion de démo : Inès
# @name ines
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/demo-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "STUDENT", "id": 2 }

### Connexion de démo : administratrice
# @name admin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/demo-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "ADMIN", "id": 1 }

### Candidatures de Lucas
GET http://localhost:3000/applications
Authorization: {{lucas.response.body.token}}

### Candidatures d'Inès
GET http://localhost:3000/applications
Authorization: {{ines.response.body.token}}

### Erreur 403 : profil non étudiant
GET http://localhost:3000/applications
Authorization: {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Erreur 401 : jeton absent
GET http://localhost:3000/applications

### Retirer la candidature en cours de Lucas (modifie les données de démo)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/applications/1/withdraw
Authorization: {{lucas.response.body.token}}

### Erreur 404 : candidature d'un autre étudiant
PATCH http://localhost:3000/applications/2/withdraw
Authorization: {{lucas.response.body.token}}

### Erreur 409 : candidature déjà retirée d'Inès
PATCH http://localhost:3000/applications/5/withdraw
Authorization: {{ines.response.body.token}}

### Erreur 403 : profil non étudiant
PATCH http://localhost:3000/applications/1/withdraw
Authorization: {{admin.response.body.token}}
